1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:07,895
School circulars arrive as PDFs, photos, and class-group messages. The small details are
easy to lose. NoticeBridge

2
00:00:07,895 --> 00:00:11,942
gives a family one noticeboard for what needs doing.

3
00:00:12,742 --> 00:00:20,630
Pin a notice from a PDF, English screenshot, or pasted text. File reading happens in the
browser. This walkthrough

4
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:24,782
uses the built-in museum trip sample and local English extraction.

5
00:00:25,582 --> 00:00:32,575
The circular becomes a checklist: submit the consent form, pay the fee, and pack for the
trip. Every extracted

6
00:00:32,575 --> 00:00:35,520
step keeps an exact quote from the source.

7
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:41,975
Before creating a reminder, check the date against the highlighted sentence. Confirm it
yourself. Missing

8
00:00:41,975 --> 00:00:46,876
years and unclear dates stay out of the export until they are reviewed.

9
00:00:47,676 --> 00:00:53,837
Now the school sends a revision. The consent deadline moves from the twenty-fourth to the
twenty-seventh of

10
00:00:53,837 --> 00:00:58,186
October. NoticeBridge crosses out the old date and asks for confirmation again.

11
00:00:58,986 --> 00:01:06,327
The packing list also adds a school ID card. Both changes are marked, while the unchanged
payment stays completed.

12
00:01:06,327 --> 00:01:09,804
The current circular remains beside the checklist for checking.

13
00:01:10,604 --> 00:01:17,473
English and Hindi board controls, Hindi sample instructions, and device read-aloud help
families use the same

14
00:01:17,473 --> 00:01:23,483
plan. Full translation of a family's own notices is available through optional AI
processing.

15
00:01:24,283 --> 00:01:30,313
The family checklist puts the revised instructions, dates, completion state, and original
quotes into one

16
00:01:30,313 --> 00:01:36,343
sheet. Copy it to a family group, save the text, or print it for home.

17
00:01:37,143 --> 00:01:43,011
The date sheet brings the remaining deadlines together. Blue marks confirmed dates. The
yellow mark here is

18
00:01:43,011 --> 00:01:45,082
a date that still needs review.

19
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:52,199
Only unfinished steps with confirmed dates are exported. In this example, the calendar file
contains one all-day

20
00:01:52,199 --> 00:01:57,402
reminder for the new consent deadline. It can be imported into a calendar app.

21
00:01:58,202 --> 00:02:05,535
The board is saved on this device. Download a backup to move circulars, progress, and
checked dates to another

22
00:02:05,535 --> 00:02:09,394
device. Restoring shows a preview before replacing the current board.

23
00:02:10,194 --> 00:02:16,648
NoticeBridge connects a school circular to the next step at home. Trace the instruction.
Catch the revision.

24
00:02:16,648 --> 00:02:21,203
Share the plan. The source code and setup are available on GitHub.
